  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'walīlo ha lūgūlū lwa Ebaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa hamò na a banamhala ba Baisilaeli būbalagīla a banhū balībawīla, “Shidimagi pyī ī shilagīlo shenīshi īsho nalīng'winha lelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulagūkīle ū mongo gwa Yolodani ng'wingīle ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīng'winha, mukūtūūla mawe mataale mugateleleje gatelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo īlī, ūlū ūlagūkīle ū mongo ūshike ū mu sī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wako alīkwinha, ī ya būhondo, gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji bako walī wakwisagīja, ūkūyandīka ī mihayo ya shilagīlo shenīshi a ha mawe genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani gatūūlagi a mawe genaya ha lūgūlū lwa Ebaali, gīt'ūmo nalīmulagīīlīla ī lelo īyī; hama mugateleleje gatelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūbeeja ho na ng'walīlo gwa mawe kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. Yaya ū kūtūmamīla shizengelo sha chūūma ū mu kūgūbeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako gwenūyo, gūzengage na mawe ga kūfuma kū malaale, hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu wako ūmfunīje ho shitambò sha kūpemva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūfunya ho na shakwinha sha būsangī, ūshilīīle henaho ūyege kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo ya shilagīlo shenīshi ūkūyandīka hape hape chiza a ha mawe ayo ūlagatūūle genayo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa na a bagabīji, a ba lūganda lwa Lawī, būbawīla pye a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Bebe Isilaeli, lembeelaga nīyo ūdegeleke chiza. Ī haha wabizaga ihanga lya banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū bizaga ng'wigwi gete ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako, shimīzīlaga ū mu katongeelele kakwe na a malange gakwe ayo nalīkwinha lelo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū Musa ūbakomeleja a banhū alīhaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ng'ūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani, ī ng'anda īji jikwīmīīla kū lūgūlū lwa Gelizimu kūbalombela a banhū, Simioni, Lawī, Yuda Isakaali, Yosefu na Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'anda īji jene jikwīmīīla kū lūgūlū lwa Ebaali kūbawīla a banhū a mazumo ayo galīho, Lubeni, Gadi, Asheli, Zabuloni, Dani na Nafutali ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī bakūbawīla pye a Basilaeli n'ilaka lya higūlya gīkī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mazumo ha lūgūlū lwa Ebaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūbeeja shiikolile sha kūlamiwa, sha mbika ya kūpūnza, nūūlū sha kūsula; shikolo īsho shilī sha malofu kūlī SEEBA, nīmo gwa makono ga banhū; hanuma ūshīmīlīja hipandī lyibisile.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūndalaha ise na nina.” A banhū a bose shibigelile bahaye, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū ū wa kūsaamya iwe lya ha lūbīmbī lwa nzenganwa ng'wiye.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūng'wīnja mboku mu nzīla, ūntongeela kūja sagala.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kwīliganya ī ng'hana ū mu kalamulīle, ūlū alīnamula ngeni nūūlū munhc wamala bakwe, nūūlū nchīlwa.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūlaala na nke o ng'wa ise, nguno alīīta mhayo gw'ibengwe kūlī ise.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūlaala na shiinū yose yose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiinū yose yose:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pyī nūūlū gūkabiza ntugo, nūūlū ndimu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūlaala n'ilūmbūye, nshīke o ng'wa ise nūūlū o ng'wa nina.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūlaala na nina būkwi.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūmūlaga nzenganwa ng'wiye mu mbisīla.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū wa kūzunya kūhongwa amūlage munhū ūyo atī na būbi.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Azumilwe ū munhū ūyo atūyīdima ī mihayo ya mu shilagīlo īshi nūūlū kwīshikīlīja.” A banhū a bose bakūhaya, “Alichene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
